---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Battery Knowledge & Data Platform"
  description="World Battery Hub — a battery knowledge and data platform covering lead-acid and lithium batteries: specifications, technology, testing, manufacturers…"
  canonical="/"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Battery Knowledge &amp; Data Platform</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        World Battery Hub is an informational battery platform, not a store. It researches and
        cross-verifies battery specifications, technology, testing methods, manufacturers and market
        data — so readers can compare and understand batteries from primary and secondary sources.
      </p>

      <div class="takeaways">
        <strong>Key takeaway:</strong> World Battery Hub covers two battery domains — <strong>lead-acid</strong> (SLI, <a href="/lead-acid/agm-battery/">AGM</a>, <a href="/lead-acid/efb-battery/">EFB</a>, start-stop, truck and <a href="/lead-acid/deep-cycle-vs-starting/">deep-cycle</a>) and <strong>lithium</strong> (<a href="/lithium/lfp-vs-nmc-vs-lto/">LFP</a>, NMC, LTO, cells, modules, packs and <a href="/lithium/what-is-bms/">BMS</a>) — across six connected assets: knowledge articles, a battery database, technology references, testing methods, a manufacturer directory and market data.
      </div>

      <h2>The six content assets</h2>
      <div class="card-grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3><a href="/lead-acid/">Lead-Acid Knowledge</a></h3>
          <p>Battery groups (<a href="https://data.worldbatteryhub.com/battery-groups/h4/">H4</a>–<a href="https://data.worldbatteryhub.com/battery-groups/h9/">H9</a>, <a href="https://data.worldbatteryhub.com/battery-groups/h4/">L1</a>–<a href="https://data.worldbatteryhub.com/battery-groups/h9/">L6</a>, JIS, DIN, BCI), <a href="/lead-acid/cca/what-is-cca/">CCA</a>, Ah, reserve capacity, AGM vs EFB vs SLI.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3><a href="/lithium/">Lithium Knowledge</a></h3>
          <p>LFP, NMC, LTO, cell/module/pack, BMS, SOC, SOH, <a href="/lithium/thermal-runaway/">thermal runaway</a> and degradation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3><a href="/technology/">Technology</a></h3>
          <p>Electrochemistry, plate design, grid, separator, electrolyte, formation and failure modes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3><a href="/testing/">Testing</a></h3>
          <p>Capacity, CCA, load, resistance, cycle and safety testing — methods, standards and interpretation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3><a href="/procurement/">Procurement Guides</a></h3>
          <p>Datasheet literacy, quotation comparison, OEM vs ODM, factory audits and JIS/DIN/BCI spec systems for importers and distributors.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3><a href="/compare/">Battery Comparisons</a></h3>
          <p>Head-to-head decision guides: AGM vs EFB vs flooded TCO, LFP vs NMC for fleets, 12V vs 24V systems, starting vs deep-cycle.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3><a href="/lead-acid/products/">Lead-Acid Product Catalogue</a></h3>
          <p>35 Powsea OEM models — filter by line or group size, with published specs and bulk inquiry.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Manufacturer Database</h3>
          <p>Battery manufacturers with verified company, product and certification data. <a href="https://manufacturer.worldbatteryhub.com">manufacturer.worldbatteryhub.com</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Market Intelligence</h3>
          <p>Production, export, price and regulation data with explicit source and methodology. <a href="https://market.worldbatteryhub.com">market.worldbatteryhub.com</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>How content is researched</h2>
      <p class="muted">Also: <a href="/tools/">battery calculators</a> (runtime, sizing, charging time) · <a href="/glossary/">battery glossary</a> · <a href="/lead-acid/products/">products (commercial)</a> (30 defined terms) · <a href="/basics/">Battery Basics 101</a> (six-lesson beginner path)</p>
      <p>
        Articles are built from public sources and cross-verified, not translated from a single source.
        Quantitative claims carry their test standard — for example a CCA value states whether it is
        JIS, EN, SAE or DIN, because a CCA number without its standard is meaningless. Where sources
        conflict, the conflict is explained rather than silently resolved. See the <a href="/about/">about page</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="muted">Last reviewed: 2026-09-14</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
